# The Docker build context is the project root (see gilhari/build.cmd and
# gilhari/build.sh). The Dockerfile copies only bin/, config/ and
# gilhari/gilhari_service.config into the image; these entries keep the rest
# of the project out of the build context. This file must stay in the
# project root: Docker reads it from the build context, not from the
# Dockerfile's directory.
.git
src
scripts
kubernetes
*.md
**/curl.log
